 #94A3B8, background #E0E5EC, surface #CBD5E1, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Secure Login</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <style>\n        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400&display=swap');\n        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }\n        input:-webkit-autofill, input:-webkit-autofill:hover, input:-webkit-autofill:focus, input:-webkit-autofill:active {\n            -webkit-box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.06), 0 0 0 30px #f8fafc inset !important;\n            -webkit-text-fill-color: #374151 !important;\n            transition: background-color 5000s ease-in-out 0s;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#e0e5ec] text-gray-800 flex items-center justify-center min-h-screen relative overflow-hidden antialiased selection:bg-blue-200\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Noise Canvas -->\n    <canvas id=\"glcanvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full z-0 pointer-events-none\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Circuit Board Background (SVG) -->\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none z-0 overflow-hidden opacity-70\">\n        <svg class=\"min-w-[1400px] h-[900px]\" viewBox=\"0 0 1400 900\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"filter: drop-shadow(1px 1px 2px rgba(163,177,198,0.4));\">\n            <defs>\n                <filter id=\"glow\" x=\"-20%\" y=\"-20%\" width=\"140%\" height=\"140%\">\n                    <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"4\" result=\"blur\" />\n                    <feComposite in=\"SourceGraphic\" in2=\"blur\" operator=\"over\" />\n                </filter>\n            </defs>\n\n            <!-- Top Left Node & Path -->\n            <g stroke=\"#c5ccd6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\">\n                <line x1=\"120\" y1=\"210\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"210\" />\n                <line x1=\"120\" y1=\"220\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"220\" />\n                <line x1=\"120\" y1=\"230\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"230\" />\n            </g>\n            <rect x=\"160\" y=\"195\" width=\"70\" height=\"50\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e0e5ec\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" />\n            <circle cx=\"215\" cy=\"220\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" filter=\"url(#glow)\" />\n            <path d=\"M 215 220 H 350 L 480 350 H 550\" stroke=\"#b0b8c4\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\" />\n\n            <!-- Bottom Left Node & Path -->\n            <g stroke=\"#c5ccd6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\">\n                <line x1=\"120\" y1=\"670\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"670\" />\n                <line x1=\"120\" y1=\"680\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"680\" />\n                <line x1=\"120\" y1=\"690\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"690\" />\n            </g>\n            <rect x=\"160\" y=\"655\" width=\"70\" height=\"50\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e0e5ec\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" />\n            <circle cx=\"215\" cy=\"680\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" filter=\"url(#glow)\" />\n            <path d=\"M 215 680 H 350 L 480 550 H 550\" stroke=\"#b0b8c4\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\" />\n\n            <!-- Top Right Node & Path -->\n            <g stroke=\"#c5ccd6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\">\n                <line x1=\"1280\" y1=\"210\" x2=\"1240\" y2=\"210\" />\n                <line x1=\"1280\" y1=\"220\" x2=\"1240\" y2=\"220\" />\n                <line x1=\"1280\" y1=\"230\" x2=\"1240\" y2=\"230\" />\n            </g>\n            <rect x=\"1170\" y=\"195\" width=\"70\" height=\"50\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e0e5ec\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" />\n            <circle cx=\"1185\" cy=\"220\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" filter=\"url(#glow)\" />\n            <path d=\"M 1185 220 H 1050 L 920 350 H 850\" stroke=\"#b0b8c4\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\" />\n\n            <!-- Bottom Right Node & Path -->\n            <g stroke=\"#c5ccd6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\">\n                <line x1=\"1280\" y1=\"670\" x2=\"1240\" y2=\"670\" />\n                <line x1=\"1280\" y1=\"680\" x2=\"1240\" y2=\"680\" />\n                <line x1=\"1280\" y1=\"690\" x2=\"1240\" y2=\"690\" />\n            </g>\n            <rect x=\"1170\" y=\"655\" width=\"70\" height=\"50\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e0e5ec\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" />\n            <circle cx=\"1185\" cy=\"680\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" filter=\"url(#glow)\" />\n            <path d=\"M 1185 680 H 1050 L 920 550 H 850\" stroke=\"#b0b8c4\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\" />\n        </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Card -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-[400px] mx-4 p-8 rounded-3xl\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #f8fafc 100%); box-shadow: 0 20px 40px -10px rgba(0,0,0,0.15), 0 0 0 1px rgba(163,177,198,0.4), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,1);\">\n\n        <!-- Header / Logo Area -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-5 mb-8\">\n            <div class=\"flex gap-1.5\">\n                <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #cbd5e1 0%, #94a3b8 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.3), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #cbd5e1 0%, #94a3b8 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.3), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #cbd5e1 0%, #94a3b8 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.3), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #cbd5e1 0%, #94a3b8 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.3), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f8fafc 0%, #e2e8f0 100%); border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.1), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,1);\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-20\" style=\"background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 1px 1px, #9ca3af 1px, transparent 0); background-size: 6px 6px;\"></div>\n                <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" class=\"relative z-10\">\n                    <path d=\"M12 3.5 C7.30558 3.5 3.5 7.30558 3.5 12 C3.5 16.6944 7.30558 20.5 12 20.5\" stroke=\"#6b7280\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" style=\"filter: drop-shadow(0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.8));\"/>\n                    <path d=\"M12 3.5 C16.6944 3.5 20.5 7.30558 20.5 12 C20.5 16.6944 16.6944 20.5 12 20.5\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" style=\"filter: drop-shadow(0 1px 2px rgba(59,130,246,0.4));\"/>\n                </svg>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"flex gap-1.5\">\n                <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #cbd5e1 0%, #94a3b8 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.3), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #cbd5e1 0%, #94a3b8 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.3), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #cbd5e1 0%, #94a3b8 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.3), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #cbd5e1 0%, #94a3b8 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.3), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Typography -->\n        <div class=\"text-center mb-8\">\n            <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-normal text-gray-900 tracking-tight mb-2\">Welcome Back</h1>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">First time? <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 transition-colors\">Register now</a></p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Form -->\n        <form class=\"space-y-5\">\n            <div class=\"relative\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 left-0 pl-4 flex items-center pointer-events-none\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:letter-linear\" class=\"text-gray-400 text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                <input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Work Email\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl py-3.5 pl-11 pr-4 text-sm text-gray-700 placeholder-gray-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-blue-400 focus:border-blue-400 transition-all\" style=\"background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.06), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\">\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"relative\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 left-0 pl-4 flex items-center pointer-events-none\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:lock-password-linear\" class=\"text-gray-400 text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                <input type=\"password\" placeholder=\"Security Key\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl py-3.5 pl-11 pr-4 text-sm text-gray-700 placeholder-gray-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-blue-400 focus:border-blue-400 transition-all\" style=\"background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.06), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\">\n            </div>\n\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"w-full text-white rounded-xl py-3.5 text-sm font-normal transition-all active:translate-y-[1px] mt-4\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #60a5fa 0%, #3b82f6 100%); border: 1px solid #2563eb; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px -2px rgba(59,130,246,0.5), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.4), inset 0 -2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.1); text-shadow: 0 -1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\">\n                Secure Login\n            </button>\n        </form>\n\n        <!-- Divider -->\n        <div class=\"my-7 flex items-center justify-center\">\n            <div class=\"h-px bg-gray-200 flex-1\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,1);\"></div>\n            <span class=\"px-4 text-xs text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-normal\">Or continue with</span>\n            <div class=\"h-px bg-gray-200 flex-1\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,1);\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Social Logins -->\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-4\">\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl py-3 transition-all active:translate-y-[1px]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #f1f5f9 100%); border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.08), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,1), inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"logos:apple\" class=\"text-lg text-gray-800\"></iconify-icon>\n            </button>\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl py-3 transition-all active:translate-y-[1px]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #f1f5f9 100%); border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.08), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,1), inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"logos:google-icon\" class=\"text-base\"></iconify-icon>\n            </button>\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl py-3 transition-all active:translate-y-[1px]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #f1f5f9 100%); border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.08), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,1), inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"ri:twitter-x-fill\" class=\"text-base text-gray-800\"></iconify-icon>\n            </button>\n        </div>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- WebGL Animated Noise Script -->\n    <script>\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('glcanvas');\n        const gl = canvas.getContext('webgl', { alpha: true, antialias: false });\n        if (gl) {\n            const pid = gl.createProgram();\n            const shader = (src, type) => {\n                const s = gl.createShader(type);\n                gl.shaderSource(s, src);\n                gl.compileShader(s);\n                gl.attachShader(pid, s);\n            };\n            shader('attribute vec2 p;void main(){gl_Position=vec4(p,0,1);}', gl.VERTEX_SHADER);\n            shader('precision lowp float;uniform float t;void main(){vec2 uv=gl_FragCoord.xy;float n=fract(sin(dot(uv,vec2(12.9898,78.233))+t)*43758.5453);gl_FragColor=vec4(vec3(0.0), n * 0.035);}', gl.FRAGMENT_SHADER);\n            gl.linkProgram(pid);\n            gl.useProgram(pid);\n            gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, gl.createBuffer());\n            gl.bufferData(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, new Float32Array([-1,-1,1,-1,-1,1,1,1]), gl.STATIC_DRAW);\n            const p = gl.getAttribLocation(pid, 'p');\n            gl.enableVertexAttribArray(p);\n            gl.vertexAttribPointer(p, 2, gl.FLOAT, false, 0, 0);\n            const tLoc = gl.getUniformLocation(pid, 't');\n\n            const resize = () => {\n                canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n                canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n                gl.viewport(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\n            };\n            window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n            resize();\n\n            const draw = (time) => {\n                gl.uniform1f(tLoc, time * 0.0005);\n                gl.drawArrays(gl.TRIANGLE_STRIP, 0, 4);\n                requestAnimationFrame(draw);\n            };\n            requestAnimationFrame(draw);\n        }\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "secure-login.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/secure-login.jpg", "source_name": "secure-login-DESIGN.md", "views": 149, "forks": 9, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-0